From 5a1785aa751adc8a69e389027c1425ccbccadbc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 02:42:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] fix(api): persist InferenceService spec and validate
 create/list input

POST /inference-services built a base Resource from the body, silently dropping
spec and status, accepted any kind, never assigned a uid and returned 200,
although the OpenAPI contract requires spec and answers 201. List endpoints
passed limit straight through, so limit=-1 returned every row.

Validate the body as a typed InferenceService (server-owned uid, tenant and
status), answer 400 with the error envelope for invalid bodies or limits
outside [1, 1000], 409 for create conflicts and for delete races, and 201 on
success.
